 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, September to October on the middle of the grids came in at 42% of normal, and in 2026 May to June stands at 72%. Grid 28041 had its driest year in 1958 at 52% of normal.</p>"}
